Use appropriate foreign keys, indexes, unique constraints, and cascading behavior.

The database should automatically initialize on first launch.

Use database migrations so future schema updates do not destroy existing data.

Implement backup and restoration functionality.

Allow the administrator to export articles in a portable format such as JSON or Markdown.

Store uploaded images in a persistent local directory, with their paths referenced from SQLite.

Do not store important uploaded files in temporary directories.

